**Tending to**|Prefix gra-|ᚌᚏᚐ
**Verb → noun (the act of [verb])**|Prefix wu-|ᚃᚒ
**Verb → noun that verb produces (e.g. know → knowledge)**|Prefix tre-|ᚈᚏᚓ
**One who [verb]s (e.g. paint → painter)**|Prefix ʦu-|ᚎᚒ
**Place of (e.g. wine → winery)**|Prefix ba-|ᚁᚐ
**Diminutive**|Prefix brui̯-|ᚁᚏᚗ
